    {
      "title": "Verb + 到 (dou3) + result = so … that",
      "explain": "Put 到 (dou3) after an adjective or verb, then say the result: 忙到冇時間食飯 (mong4 dou3 mou5 si4 gaan3 sik6 faan6) 'so busy I have no time to eat'.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "en": "I'm so tired I can't open my eyes.",
